Why MuPDF 1.1: built for the KN7000 (mn10300-elf-gcc -Os, --gc-sections), a viewer that opens a PDF and draws a page
needs 1.36 MB of code with MuPDF master but 0.85 MB with 1.1, the same libraries in both (README.md, "Memory";
the measuring scripts are tools/measure/).
